# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets redirects.
#
# Canonical host is `universefocuses.com` (no www). Anyone landing on
# the www form gets bounced to the apex with a permanent (301) redirect
# so localStorage / sessionStorage / cookies all live under one origin
# — without this, a user who signs in on universefocuses.com would have
# to sign in again when they hit www.universefocuses.com (different
# origin = different storage). Same reasoning fixes the Spotify
# redirect-URI mismatch class of bugs (one canonical host, one
# registered redirect URI).
#
# Format: <from>  <to>  <status>
# `:splat` matches the wildcard part of the source path so query strings
# and deep paths are preserved verbatim.

https://www.universefocuses.com/*  https://universefocuses.com/:splat  301
